spans.s:
(IV)--The preceptor of the Daityas and Asuras;
1: वा. 3. 5; ६२. ८०; वा. ६५. ७४.
on शिशुमारचक्र;
2: भा. V. २३. 7.
disciple of the father of बृहस्पति and leader of a side of Soma (पार्ष्णि);
3: वा. ९०. ३०.
father of देवयानी; by his curse ययाती could not enjoy his youth to the full and hence requested his sons to give their youth in exchange for his old age.
4: ६५. ८४; ९३. ३०; १०३. ५९.
Praised अमरकण्टकक्षेत्र;
5: वा. ७७. १४.
a sage;
6: वा. ३०. ८५; ५९. ९०.
see शुक्र।
